 stating that this License applies to the work.

  You may convey covered works to others for the sole purpose of having
 them make modifications exclusively for you, or provide you with
 facilities for running those works, provided that you comply with this
 License in conveying all material for which you do not receive
 remuneration, and that you ensure that the other parties uphold this
 License.  You may use technical measures (such as encryption or DRM)
 to obstruct access to non-source forms of the covered work during
